    {
      "id": "3E_Ub6mLaAvD2OMrkat6L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -713.1595674731627,
      "y": -27925.00001425436,
      "width": 1009.2994384765625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b31",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1238960253,
      "version": 805,
      "versionNonce": 105148797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785568057035,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Contention occurs when multiple process complete for same resource at the same time\n(eg: booking ticket, bidding auction). Without proper handling, we will get \nrace condition, double booking, inconsistent state\n\n\"Lost update\":\n- 2 requests read the same value, both act on it, both write back, so one silently overwrite the others\n- Solutions:\n1) Conditional Writes\n2) Pessimistic Locking\n3) Optimistic concurrency control\n4) Isolation levels\n5) Distributed locks\n\n\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Contention occurs when multiple process complete for same resource at the same time\n(eg: booking ticket, bidding auction). Without proper handling, we will get \nrace condition, double booking, inconsistent state\n\n\"Lost update\":\n- 2 requests read the same value, both act on it, both write back, so one silently overwrite the others\n- Solutions:\n1) Conditional Writes\n2) Pessimistic Locking\n3) Optimistic concurrency control\n4) Isolation levels\n5) Distributed locks\n\n\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
