    {
      "id": "UWQfz0sRnGJnvxyJM9wxR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52.57618748088771,
      "y": -27122.397058471237,
      "width": 763.247314453125,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b36",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 472006173,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 1878716861,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785540482658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Safe under concurrency, no matter how many people try to grab the last ticket at once,\nonly one will succeed. \n- Since DB won't let 2 updates change same row at the same time\n- The rule worth remembering is that the guard has to protect the thing being contended. \nA counter can answer \"is there a ticket left.\" Only the ticket row can answer \"is this ticket left.\"\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Safe under concurrency, no matter how many people try to grab the last ticket at once,\nonly one will succeed. \n- Since DB won't let 2 updates change same row at the same time\n- The rule worth remembering is that the guard has to protect the thing being contended. \nA counter can answer \"is there a ticket left.\" Only the ticket row can answer \"is this ticket left.\"\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mAzs3ndH0VhKkT9YFc98m",
